    "_comment": "Route authorization for TrustOps (design A §8.2). Default deny; any matching allow grants unless a matching deny exists (deny overrides). 'path' is the FastAPI route template relative to the service's APP_ROOT_PATH. Matcher: exact, '{param}' segments (an exact literal rule for the same service and method wins over a template), and a trailing '/*' for one or more further segments. role_hierarchy is data (fixes the hard-coded AEO map): a role inherits the permissions of every role in its list. Deny rules match the caller's own roles, not inherited ones.",
